  "details": "# Issue:\nBetween different options in the Settings Tab you can find a small dark gray separation line. Some options though have that line at the bottom of them, even though there are no other options behind it.\nHere is a list of the ones I've seen so far (Desktop):\n1. User Interface: General Settings: Slider Snapping\n2. User Interface: Visuals: Escape background\n3. Accessibility: Comfort: Locomotion and tunnelling\n# Attachments:\nHere you can see what I mean:",
